<div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">
 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold" id="toc939868_19">Executive Officers </p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The executive officers of Codexis are set forth below: </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
